{
  "name": "USCC Validator",
  "description": "Validate Unified Social Credit Codes offline by GB 32100-2015 — length, characters and check digit — and explain every field",
  "help": [
    "Follows GB 32100-2015 and Amendment No.1: 18 characters, digits and uppercase letters except I O Z S V, and an 18th character computed from the first 17 by weighted sum modulo 31. Errors point at the position and show the expected check digit.",
    "Splits the registration authority, organization type, region code, subject identifier and check digit. Authorities or types missing from the built-in tables are marked for review instead of failing. Only province names are built in; city and county codes are shown for manual review.",
    "Accepts multi-line text and a CSV column. Surrounding blanks, inner spaces, lowercase and full-width characters are normalized and clearly flagged; source files are never modified. Copy or export results as CSV / JSON.",
    "Passing only means the code follows the coding rules; it does not prove the organization exists, operates normally or has any credit status."
  ],
